          "text": "Projection wand",
          "centered": true,
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "modopedia:text",
          "x": 2,
          "y": 16,
          "width": 96,
          "line_height": 9,
          "text": "The wand stores tested canvases in WAND_CONTENTS and projects them onto multiple planes using WandLayout. The default layout has planes at 1 and 1.5 blocks."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• Shift+right-click opens configuration; canvases in slots are copied into wand data."
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• Hold right-click to create projection entities; release to stop through WandProjectionService."
    },
    {
      "type": "modopedia:text",
      "x": 2,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 96,
      "line_height": 9,
      "text": "• Projection reuses rendering and compiled data; it does not delete the source canvas."
    },
